---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Ancient Chinese Architecture" description="Privacy policy for Ancient Chinese Architecture — what data we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have.">
  <Nav />
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16 px-6 bg-stone-light">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-vermillion text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 font-display">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink-muted space-y-4">
        <p>Last updated: September 2026</p>
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Ancient Chinese Architecture ("we", "us") collects, uses, and protects information when you visit ancient-chinese-architecture.com.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-ink mt-8 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We are a static, informational website. We do not require registration and do not collect personal data such as names, email addresses, or account credentials.</p>
        <p>We use Google Analytics (Google Analytics 4) to understand aggregate traffic patterns — which pages are read, from where, and on what devices. Google Analytics collects anonymous usage data including IP address (in anonymized form), browser type, device type, and pages visited.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-ink mt-8 mb-4">How We Use Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>To measure and improve the usefulness of our content.</li>
          <li>To understand which topics visitors find most valuable.</li>
          <li>To diagnose technical issues and ensure the site works correctly.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade personal information to third parties.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-ink mt-8 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
        <p>Google Analytics may set cookies to distinguish unique users. These cookies do not collect information that personally identifies you. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="text-vermillion hover:text-vermillion-dark transition-colors">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a> or by blocking analytics cookies in your browser settings.</p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-ink mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@ancient-chinese-architecture.com" class="text-vermillion hover:text-vermillion-dark transition-colors">hello@ancient-chinese-architecture.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
